	METHOD j hasDirectSignal (IIII)Z
		COMMENT returns whether the block at the given position is emitting a direct regstone signal in the given direction
		COMMENT this roughly equates to what colloquially known as 'hard' or 'stone' power
		COMMENT
		COMMENT <p>
		COMMENT NOTE: the directions in redstone signal related methods are backwards, so this method
		COMMENT checks for the signal emitted in the direction <i>opposite</i> of the one given
		ARG 1 x
		ARG 2 y
		ARG 3 z
		ARG 4 dir
